 \"Kaggle Error\" issue today. What helped me was switching Editor type from Script to Notebook. No code changes required. Then it worked fine.", "content": "<p>I faced the same \"Kaggle Error\" issue today. What helped me was switching Editor type from Script to Notebook. No code changes required. Then it worked fine.</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Patrik Pivoda", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/21542200-kg.png?t=2024-07-02-06-14-19", "url": "/patrikpivoda", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 21542200, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"canUpvote": true}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 1474, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "reactions": [{"emoji": "THANK_YOU", "featuredUserNames": ["jasongyoon"], "userCount": 1}], "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Patrik Pivoda", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/21542200-kg.png?t=2024-07-02-06-14-19", "url": "/patrikpivoda", "userName": "patrikpivoda", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 21542200, "profileUrl": "/patrikpivoda", "performanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "userId": 21542200, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, {"id": 3429922, "postDate": "2026-03-27T14:58:14.070Z", "rawMarkdown": "this issue is not reproduced after change to Fourier, fyi\n\n![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F11332358%2Ff9ea5c7c19e5f2dddf49b580f67955e7%2FScreenshot%202026-03-27%20095224.png?generation=1774623175147204&alt=media)\n", "content": "<p>this issue is not reproduced after change to Fourier, fyi</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F11332358%2Ff9ea5c7c19e5f2dddf49b580f67955e7%2FScreenshot%202026-03-27%20095224.png?generation=1774623175147204&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Jason Yoon", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/11332358-kg.jpg?t=2026-08-05-21-16-03", "url": "/jasongyoon", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 11332358, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "TOPIC", "votes": {"canUpvote": true}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 2125, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Jason Yoon", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/11332358-kg.jpg?t=2026-08-05-21-16-03", "url": "/jasongyoon", "userName": "jasongyoon", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 11332358, "profileUrl": "/jasongyoon", "performanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "userId": 11332358, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, {"id": 3429477, "postDate": "2026-03-26T19:17:23.433Z", "rawMarkdown": "I am dealing with the same issue - I wonder if there is a specific format that is required. \nIt could also be due to runtime errors though when exposed to private games. \n\n![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F31880433%2F13b8616c029821113ad43f56b16aba3b%2Fparquet.jpg?generation=1774552879100679&alt=media)\n\nEDIT: I was eventually able to get my submissions to work. what I am doing now is creating a parquet placeholder before anything executes, so that in case something fails in the private eval, it will still submit.", "content": "<p>I am dealing with the same issue - I wonder if there is a specific format that is required. \nIt could also be due to runtime errors though when exposed to private games. </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F31880433%2F13b8616c029821113ad43f56b16aba3b%2Fparquet.jpg?generation=1774552879100679&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>EDIT: I was eventually able to get my submissions to work. what I am doing now is creating a parquet placeholder before anything executes, so that in case something fails in the private eval, it will still submit.</p